{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lost Vulcan - A roguelite platformer that revives the spirit of classic arcade games!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The legend of Vulcan is calling you... will you answer the challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the depths of space lies Vulcan, a colossal abandoned ship that hides legendary riches, deadly traps, and foes that will push even the most experienced bounty hunters to their limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Master the art of arcade survival:</strong><br>\u2022 \ud83c\udfae Precise classic-style controls with the depth of modern roguelites<br>\u2022 \ud83e\udde9 6 unique zones filled with clever traps and enemies<br>\u2022 \ud83d\udca5 7 epic bosses that will test all your gaming skills<br>\u2022 \ud83d\udd04 180 handcrafted levels ensuring no two runs are alike<br>\u2022 \ud83d\udd13 Addictive progression: Unlock new characters and upgrades each run<br>\u2022 \ud83c\udfb5 Chiptune soundtrack that transports you to gaming's golden age</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Are you willing to risk it all for the treasure?</strong>\u00a0In Lost Vulcan, every jump and every shot could mean the difference between glory... and a premature death.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1112630?t=1747866807","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1112630/73dca202cff02978b97c09b82afeba37f7973bec/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747866807","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1112630/192a869fb5da6e0ab7d853a68521d254e9159dd9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747866807","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1112630/192a869fb5da6e0ab7d853a68521d254e9159dd9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747866807","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":4